REGEDIT4

; Tell Media Foundation that these containers can be opened, by mapping them to
; the GStreamer byte-stream handler that CrossOver already registers as a COM
; server ("Generic Decodebin Byte Stream Handler").
;
; Without a mapping, Media Foundation will not open the file by extension at
; all -- and the failure is quiet: a source reader is created, returns success,
; and is then never read from. That is exactly what NINJA GAIDEN 4 was measured
; doing on 2026-08-27 while its .msd went unmapped.
;
; .webm was the original entry, for DYNASTY WARRIORS: ORIGINS on Preview.
; .mkv and .msd were added after reading winevideo's own page for NINJA GAIDEN 4,
; which says its prepared bottle receives all three.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Microsoft\Windows Media Foundation\ByteStreamHandlers\.webm]
"{317df618-5e5a-468a-9f15-d827a9a08162}"="GStreamer Byte Stream Handler"

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Microsoft\Windows Media Foundation\ByteStreamHandlers\.mkv]
"{317df618-5e5a-468a-9f15-d827a9a08162}"="GStreamer Byte Stream Handler"

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Microsoft\Windows Media Foundation\ByteStreamHandlers\.msd]
"{317df618-5e5a-468a-9f15-d827a9a08162}"="GStreamer Byte Stream Handler"
